WEBVTT

00:02.060 --> 00:05.980
<b><i>Finishing the outdoor class
held with Adler and Lang dorms,</i></b>

00:06.270 --> 00:08.980
<b><i>Mash obtained a gold coin.</i></b>

00:09.780 --> 00:15.360
<b><i>However, despite Lance's warning,
Mash got lost at school,</i></b>

00:15.610 --> 00:19.490
<b><i>and somehow found himself
at the center of rivaling Lang dorm.</i></b>

00:19.490 --> 00:23.160
<b><i>The headquarters of Magia Lupus.</i></b>

01:54.800 --> 01:58.130
<b>You know
that's a doll you're talking to?</b>

01:58.590 --> 02:00.550
<b>Thank you for bringing that to my attention.</b>

02:00.890 --> 02:02.430
<b>You're welcome.</b>

02:03.140 --> 02:07.640
<b>So you're the first-year with the gold coin.</b>

02:07.940 --> 02:09.770
<b>Yes, that's me.</b>

02:10.060 --> 02:13.400
<b>Why do you wish to be a Divine Visionary?</b>

02:14.360 --> 02:16.690
<b>To live peacefully with my family.</b>

02:17.360 --> 02:20.910
<b>Splendid. However...</b>

02:21.910 --> 02:23.700
<b>You are misguided.</b>

02:24.490 --> 02:29.000
<b>The Divine Visionaries
are the artisans of our world.</b>

02:29.330 --> 02:32.130
<b>They literally are the vessels of God's divinity.</b>

02:32.500 --> 02:36.920
<b>You lack the mettle necessary
to be a creator deity.</b>

02:37.420 --> 02:39.380
<b>Then, what about you?</b>

02:39.380 --> 02:43.680
<b>I will return this world to its rightful form.</b>

02:44.010 --> 02:47.060
<b>Do you know why humanity has flourished?</b>

02:47.390 --> 02:53.440
<b>Because we tirelessly pillage, use,
and devour those weaker than us.</b>

02:53.770 --> 02:56.780
<b>But look at society now.</b>

02:56.980 --> 03:01.570
<b>Sheltering the weak, fighting for equality,
encouraging compassion...</b>

03:02.200 --> 03:03.950
<b>It's nonsense.</b>

03:05.830 --> 03:11.000
<b>Society wants to shut their eyes,
and try their hardest to avert reality.</b>

03:12.370 --> 03:14.790
<b>We are beasts by nature.</b>

03:15.090 --> 03:21.800
<b>Even in human society, the weak are pillaged,
taken advantage of, and weeded out.</b>

03:22.380 --> 03:26.350
<b>Thus, it is we, the superior beings,
who prosper.</b>

03:26.930 --> 03:29.350
<b>That is the law of nature.</b>

03:31.140 --> 03:32.560
<b>I get it.</b>

03:33.060 --> 03:34.560
<b>So you're saying...</b>

03:36.020 --> 03:39.110
<b>you want to live peacefully as well?</b>

03:43.200 --> 03:45.200
<b>What is he talking about?</b>

03:45.490 --> 03:47.580
<b>Was he listening at all?</b>

03:49.540 --> 03:52.830
<b>I will take those words as hostility.</b>

03:52.830 --> 03:55.960
<b>I didn't mean it that way. I'm sorry.</b>

03:56.710 --> 03:57.920
<b>I see.</b>

03:58.550 --> 04:03.840
<b>Then I will allow you to go,
in exchange for your gold coin.</b>

04:05.590 --> 04:06.970
<b>How about no?</b>

04:08.760 --> 04:10.100
<b>I see.</b>

04:10.390 --> 04:13.350
<b>Well, you have no right to refuse.</b>

04:18.070 --> 04:19.110
<b><i>A puppet?</i></b>

04:30.620 --> 04:33.120
<b>That wasn't much of a challenge.</b>

04:40.380 --> 04:42.300
<b>What's with this puppet?</b>

04:42.550 --> 04:45.050
<b>It's been pumping iron
a lot more than the other one.</b>

04:57.810 --> 05:01.690
<b>I will put this coin to good use.</b>

05:03.650 --> 05:07.110
<b>I'm sorry I said
you weren't much of a challenge.</b>

05:08.200 --> 05:14.580
<b>STOMP STOMP</b>

05:10.280 --> 05:14.580
<b>Huh? Whoops.
Almost stomped someone to death.</b>

05:16.580 --> 05:20.090
<b>Hey, I'm going to take him
to the nurse's office.</b>

05:21.420 --> 05:23.210
<b>You're giving up your coin?</b>

05:23.380 --> 05:27.260
<b>No, but I'm prioritizing.</b>

05:27.720 --> 05:28.800
<b>Besides...</b>

05:29.390 --> 05:33.850
<b>It doesn't matter how strong you are.
I'm not gonna lose.</b>

05:39.730 --> 05:41.110
<b>Oh?</b>

05:41.400 --> 05:43.480
<b>Now, if you'll excuse me.</b>

05:46.860 --> 05:49.200
<b><i>His overwhelming confidence.</i></b>

05:49.620 --> 05:53.120
<b><i>Is he simply thoughtless, or is he...</i></b>

05:54.500 --> 05:56.460
<b><i>Something doesn't feel right.</i></b>

06:00.630 --> 06:02.880
<b><i>My puppet is missing a button.</i></b>

06:08.380 --> 06:12.600
<b><i>I think I just witnessed
something unthinkable.</i></b>

06:14.850 --> 06:17.390
<b><i>When the puppet flung over the coin,</i></b>

06:17.940 --> 06:21.310
<b><i>Mushroom Head ripped something
off the puppet,</i></b>

06:22.730 --> 06:24.940
<b><i>sent it flying with tremendous force,</i></b>

06:25.110 --> 06:28.570
<b><i>hit the coin mid-air,
and when it was floating...</i></b>

06:29.320 --> 06:31.450
<b><i>he sucked the coin up
using the power of his lungs alone!</i></b>

06:34.030 --> 06:36.160
<b><i>Wait, is that what I saw?</i></b>

06:40.040 --> 06:41.460
<b>Interesting.</b>

06:42.330 --> 06:43.920
<b>That was close.</b>

06:45.380 --> 06:49.220
<b>What was a person doing
lying on the floor there anyway?</b>

06:49.970 --> 06:52.850
<b>He's unconscious.
Better get him there quickly.</b>

07:00.140 --> 07:02.690
<b><i>What the... I'm human again.</i></b>

07:03.310 --> 07:06.610
<b><i>I can't remember anything that happened
after I was turned into a doll.</i></b>

07:06.730 --> 07:08.610
<b><i>How the hell did I...</i></b>

07:08.610 --> 07:10.240
<b>HMPH HMPH HMPH HMPH</b>

07:10.240 --> 07:13.070
<b>BAM BAM BAM BAM</b>

07:13.200 --> 07:16.080
<b>Wh-What the hell are you doing!?</b>

07:17.580 --> 07:19.580
<b>Working my exterior obliques.</b>

07:19.750 --> 07:21.460
<b>Oh... Okay.</b>

07:21.790 --> 07:25.750
<b>Wait, the fact that you're here
means you brought me...</b>

07:26.670 --> 07:27.590
<b>That's right.</b>

07:28.800 --> 07:30.090
<b>Why?</b>

07:34.300 --> 07:36.680
<b>I was your enemy.</b>

07:39.930 --> 07:41.440
<b>Well...</b>

07:41.440 --> 07:42.940
<b>When one of us is in trouble,
we're all in tr—</b>

07:43.190 --> 07:43.940
<b>BITE</b>

07:44.610 --> 07:47.400
<b>Mhy tohnge... Nearly bit it off...</b>

07:47.400 --> 07:48.980
<b>I-I see.</b>

07:50.900 --> 07:52.740
<b>Okay, I'm going now.</b>

07:53.160 --> 07:54.280
<b>Take care of yourself.</b>

07:54.620 --> 07:56.160
<b>Huh? Sure.</b>

08:00.500 --> 08:03.540
<b>When one of us is in trouble,
we're all in trouble, huh?</b>

08:04.000 --> 08:06.170
<b>Damn that punk.</b>

08:06.960 --> 08:10.920
<b><i>Meanwhile, back at Adler dorm room 302...</i></b>

08:11.220 --> 08:14.220
<b>RUMBLE RUMBLE</b>

08:14.220 --> 08:17.220
<b>RUMBLE RUMBLE</b>

08:17.390 --> 08:19.770
<b>What do you think you're doing here?</b>

08:19.770 --> 08:22.480
<b>And did you change your hairstyle?</b>

08:22.600 --> 08:26.190
<b>That's my line!
I just got a new look. Call it a makeover!</b>

08:26.440 --> 08:30.610
<b>Lemon seems to like guys
with bangs, so you know...</b>

08:30.860 --> 08:34.490
<b>Lance, Dot, why are you two
arguing in my room?</b>

08:35.070 --> 08:38.410
<b><i>His face clearly scores above 70th percentile.</i></b>

08:38.410 --> 08:39.990
<b><i>And being so tall...</i></b>

08:40.080 --> 08:43.830
<b><i>His difficulty playing the game of life is...
Easy Mode.</i></b>

08:44.620 --> 08:47.630
<b>My dissatisfaction level is at 500%.</b>

08:47.840 --> 08:49.250
<b>Now get outta this room!</b>

08:49.420 --> 08:51.630
<b>But this is my room!</b>

08:51.760 --> 08:54.090
<b>Just looking at ya pisses me off!</b>

08:54.180 --> 08:57.390
<b>I hate good-lookin' guys to death!</b>

08:59.510 --> 09:02.770
<b>I hate rude boors to death, too.</b>

09:02.770 --> 09:05.900
<b>I can eradicate you
from this world right now, you know?</b>

09:07.020 --> 09:09.900
<b>Bring it on. I'll triple-kill ya!</b>

09:10.190 --> 09:11.280
<b>Um, err...</b>

09:11.690 --> 09:14.030
<b>Very well. I will take you on.</b>

09:14.030 --> 09:17.070
<b>Wait, no, please...</b>

09:17.070 --> 09:20.530
<b>I beg you, if you're gonna
do anything, do it outside!</b>

09:18.120 --> 09:20.530
<b>RAH</b>

09:20.700 --> 09:21.040
<b>BANG</b>

09:22.040 --> 09:25.960
<b>Right. You'll break stuff inside the room,
so can you take it outside?</b>

09:27.370 --> 09:29.000
<b><i>The most contradictory of contradictions.</i></b>

09:29.000 --> 09:31.340
<b><i>What a great contradiction.</i></b>

09:32.460 --> 09:33.420
<b>Sheesh.</b>

09:33.960 --> 09:36.010
<b>Gimme a break. Seriously.</b>

09:38.180 --> 09:39.470
<b>Here, take this.</b>

09:39.470 --> 09:40.720
<b>What is this?</b>

09:40.720 --> 09:44.730
<b>What? Always have a gift when you drop by
someone else's place.</b>

09:44.730 --> 09:45.810
<b>That's common sense.</b>

09:46.850 --> 09:50.310
<b><i>Despite talking and acting like a ruffian,
Dot may have a good upbringing?</i></b>

09:50.900 --> 09:53.070
<b><i>And it's herb tea to boot.</i></b>

09:53.280 --> 09:56.990
<b>That one has a really good aroma.
It's my favorite.</b>

09:57.070 --> 09:58.070
<b>S-Sure.</b>

09:58.660 --> 10:01.580
<b><i>He looks like this, but loves herb tea?</i></b>

10:01.780 --> 10:03.160
<b>Well...</b>

10:03.330 --> 10:07.080
<b>All in all, today is another peaceful day.</b>

10:03.330 --> 10:07.080
<b>NOM NOM NOM</b>

10:07.290 --> 10:09.210
<b>Why are you so complacent?</b>

10:09.330 --> 10:12.840
<b>We need to strategize ways to acquire coins.</b>

10:13.130 --> 10:15.090
<b>Man, I want a girlfriend.</b>

10:15.260 --> 10:18.010
<b><i>Not one of them are on the same page!</i></b>

10:19.640 --> 10:21.850
<b>Big news!</b>

10:23.010 --> 10:26.100
<b><i>Four men. One of me...</i></b>

10:26.180 --> 10:27.980
<b>You beasts!</b>

10:26.430 --> 10:31.110
<b>WRIGGLE WRIGGLE</b>

10:27.980 --> 10:31.110
<b>We're not doing anything!
You're the one who came in here!</b>

10:32.060 --> 10:33.110
<b>That's right!</b>

10:33.400 --> 10:35.030
<b>Everyone, come with me!</b>

10:37.570 --> 10:39.110
<b>What is this?</b>

10:39.360 --> 10:44.120
<b>This Magic Scale displays
how many gold coins each dorm has.</b>

10:44.740 --> 10:46.120
<b>Look closely.</b>

10:46.450 --> 10:50.750
<b>Lang dorm has most of the gold coins for now.</b>

10:51.040 --> 10:55.500
<b>On the other hand,
we Adler only have Mash's one coin.</b>

10:55.880 --> 11:01.590
<b>Since the start of this school year, Lang has been
nabbing all the other dorms' coins.</b>

11:02.140 --> 11:08.770
<b>Adler upperclassmen who could stop them
are all away for off-campus internships.</b>

11:09.230 --> 11:13.730
<b>Lang dorm are blood-purists
with an exclusionary ideology.</b>

11:13.730 --> 11:17.780
<b>If this keeps up, Lang will produce
this year's Divine Visionary.</b>

11:18.440 --> 11:22.240
<b>Orca students basically
devote themselves to research.</b>

11:22.740 --> 11:28.410
<b>Which means it's up to us Adlers
to put a stop to their plan.</b>

11:28.580 --> 11:31.830
<b><i>Lemon's going out of her way
to break the situation down for us.</i></b>

11:31.830 --> 11:34.670
<b><i>She's so sweet. I'm in wuv!</i></b>

11:34.750 --> 11:38.420
<b>And so, please try hard, Mash!</b>

11:38.420 --> 11:39.340
<b>'Kay.</b>

11:40.590 --> 11:42.050
<b>I see.</b>

11:42.050 --> 11:47.560
<b>This means I need to snuff out the guys
from Lang to fulfill my objective.</b>

11:48.140 --> 11:49.560
<b>That's what this means.</b>

11:49.930 --> 11:52.810
<b>All right, dammit! Let's kill 'em!</b>

11:53.190 --> 11:55.440
<b>Everyone, best of luck.</b>

11:56.480 --> 11:59.240
<b>These muscles will flex</b>

11:59.360 --> 12:01.450
<b>in the name of peace.</b>

12:09.500 --> 12:17.460
<b><i>About your actions... I decided I must
give you reprimand, even if superficial.</i></b>

12:17.920 --> 12:22.090
<b><i>Therefore, you are to clean
the owl huts for a week.</i></b>

12:24.470 --> 12:27.010
<b>So much for getting right into it.</b>

12:27.010 --> 12:28.600
<b>I was a bit motivated, too.</b>

12:30.060 --> 12:31.810
<b>I've come to help you out.</b>

12:31.810 --> 12:33.350
<b>Huh? Why?</b>

12:34.020 --> 12:35.350
<b>It's simple.</b>

12:35.810 --> 12:40.990
<b>Lang guys might come into contact with you,
targeting your coin.</b>

12:40.990 --> 12:42.860
<b>And I will hunt them down.</b>

12:43.070 --> 12:45.030
<b>You're worried about me?</b>

12:45.160 --> 12:46.910
<b>That's not it. I'll kill you.</b>

12:55.750 --> 12:57.920
<b>Olore, did you know?</b>

13:03.260 --> 13:06.550
<b>Once time passes, it never returns.</b>

13:06.970 --> 13:11.720
<b>Stop stating the obvious
as if it's a profound statement.</b>

13:11.720 --> 13:13.520
<b>It wastes time.</b>

13:16.480 --> 13:20.110
<b>Now, shall we acquire another gold coin?</b>

13:20.110 --> 13:24.200
<b>No one can stop the flow of time.</b>

13:26.320 --> 13:30.030
<b><i>Mash was cleaning up the owl huts.</i></b>

13:30.620 --> 13:30.950
<b>POKE</b>

13:31.240 --> 13:31.580
<b>POKE</b>

13:31.790 --> 13:41.800
<b>POKE POKE POKE</b>

13:32.080 --> 13:33.830
<b>Did I do something to them?</b>

13:33.830 --> 13:37.250
<b>It's disturbing
how much those owls hate you.</b>

13:39.960 --> 13:41.800
<b>What in the world have I done?</b>

13:43.170 --> 13:44.920
<b>Sea Field.</b>

13:48.340 --> 13:49.470
<b>Mash!</b>

13:49.600 --> 13:50.720
<b>Shuriketh.</b>

13:53.390 --> 13:56.600
<b>Greetings, Adlers.</b>

13:56.890 --> 13:59.610
<b>We've come for your coin.</b>

13:59.730 --> 14:02.360
<b>You must be from Lang.</b>

14:02.530 --> 14:04.570
<b>Yes, we are.</b>

14:04.570 --> 14:09.370
<b>We are from Magia Lupus.
I'm Sixth Fang, Olore Andrew, and...</b>

14:06.900 --> 14:09.370
<b>SIXTH FANG: OLORE ANDREW</b>

14:09.700 --> 14:13.370
<b>Seventh Fang, Anser Shinri.</b>

14:10.910 --> 14:13.370
<b>SEVENTH FANG: ANSER SHINRI</b>

14:13.700 --> 14:14.830
<b>Interesting.</b>

14:14.830 --> 14:19.120
<b>The one suited to become
Divine Visionary is neither of you.</b>

14:19.330 --> 14:23.130
<b>So let's battle now for each other's coins.</b>

14:23.130 --> 14:25.880
<b>* HELP ME. I'VE NEVER SWUM BEFORE IN MY LIFE.</b>

14:26.800 --> 14:30.640
<b>I will join you soon...
Sea Shark!</b>

14:33.640 --> 14:35.810
<b>BAM</b>

14:34.180 --> 14:36.350
<b>The hunt's on.</b>

14:38.520 --> 14:40.600
<b>Guess I'm left with you.</b>

14:41.230 --> 14:44.400
<b>Let me tell you something important.</b>

14:46.940 --> 14:48.360
<b>In a fight...</b>

14:49.240 --> 14:52.660
<b>there is always a winner and a loser.</b>

14:55.240 --> 14:56.450
<b><i>Damn him.</i></b>

14:56.450 --> 15:00.250
<b><i>He states the obvious like it was a profound
statement, and even pauses in delivery.</i></b>

15:00.250 --> 15:02.170
<b><i>I wish I didn't ask.</i></b>

15:02.420 --> 15:04.090
<b>Shuriketh.</b>

15:05.670 --> 15:08.970
<b><i>His magic merely controls
that disc-shaped weapon.</i></b>

15:09.430 --> 15:11.090
<b><i>My gravity magic can...</i></b>

15:13.010 --> 15:13.680
<b>Gravio...</b>

15:15.060 --> 15:16.930
<b><i>The owls?</i></b>

15:17.140 --> 15:17.930
<b>Shuriketh!</b>

15:19.190 --> 15:21.900
<b><i>Oh no. Owls have nothing to do with this.</i></b>

15:21.900 --> 15:24.060
<b><i>My gravity magic will get him.</i></b>

15:24.650 --> 15:25.270
<b>Gravio...</b>

15:25.610 --> 15:29.400
<b><i>Big Brother!
Don't pick on those poor owls!</i></b>

15:32.870 --> 15:35.080
<b>You're right, my little sister.</b>

15:35.080 --> 15:37.290
<b>Your big brother was mistaken.</b>

15:37.450 --> 15:40.960
<b>What's wrong? This world
is about survival of the fittest.</b>

15:40.960 --> 15:44.290
<b>Only the strong and the weak exist.</b>

15:44.670 --> 15:46.590
<b>Shuriketh... Double!</b>

15:47.130 --> 15:49.840
<b><i>Oh no, the owls behind me...</i></b>

15:58.020 --> 16:00.270
<b>Your wand is made of magnolia.</b>

16:00.270 --> 16:02.390
<b>You're the Crown family's kid, aren't you?</b>

16:02.770 --> 16:07.070
<b>The prestigious Crown family,
famed for their gravitation magic.</b>

16:07.610 --> 16:12.610
<b>I heard their eldest son ran off.
I can't believe...</b>

16:13.280 --> 16:15.870
<b>he turned out to be so weak.</b>

16:17.740 --> 16:21.540
<b>Did you leave due to your lack of talent?</b>

16:21.790 --> 16:25.630
<b>I sympathize. You are one of the weak.</b>

16:26.130 --> 16:27.590
<b>Did you know?</b>

16:28.130 --> 16:32.510
<b>Overwhelming the weak
feels better than anything else.</b>

16:32.720 --> 16:36.600
<b>Humans can evaluate themselves
only by comparing themselves with others.</b>

16:36.600 --> 16:41.520
<b>Since there is someone below you,
you can acknowledge your own superiority.</b>

16:41.770 --> 16:45.520
<b>There is a necessity for existences like you.</b>

16:47.150 --> 16:48.400
<b>Graviole.</b>

16:55.990 --> 16:59.240
<b>That's enough.
I will put you at ease.</b>

16:59.660 --> 17:06.250
<b><i>By defeating a Crown, I can once again
acknowledge that I am a superior being.</i></b>

17:06.830 --> 17:08.750
<b>Shuriketh Triple!</b>

17:11.010 --> 17:12.800
<b><i>Why do I feel like something is off?</i></b>

17:14.010 --> 17:15.760
<b><i>All the owls are in one spot?</i></b>

17:17.680 --> 17:18.760
<b>Graviole.</b>

17:23.140 --> 17:25.520
<b>The owls were in the way.</b>

17:25.730 --> 17:27.730
<b>So I moved them over.</b>

17:28.440 --> 17:29.860
<b><i>Impossible.</i></b>

17:30.270 --> 17:34.650
<b><i>With the first spell, he controlled the shovel
hanging on the hut wall to cut open the bag of feed,</i></b>

17:34.650 --> 17:36.780
<b><i>and lured all the owls over.</i></b>

17:37.910 --> 17:41.790
<b><i>He wasn't attacking me the whole time
because he was worried about the owls?</i></b>

17:43.410 --> 17:44.710
<b>Don't mock me!</b>

17:44.710 --> 17:46.540
<b>Large Shuriketh!</b>

17:46.920 --> 17:49.290
<b>This spell is my most...</b>

17:49.290 --> 17:50.210
<b>Graviole.</b>

18:00.140 --> 18:05.230
<b><i>What? We're both the same double-liners.
What is this overwhelming difference in power?</i></b>

18:05.230 --> 18:10.610
<b>For you, battles are where you gain
a sense of superiority.</b>

18:11.230 --> 18:12.610
<b>It's not the same for me.</b>

18:13.150 --> 18:17.110
<b>I am forced to fight for the sake
of my dear little sister.</b>

18:17.490 --> 18:19.870
<b>What are you trying to say?</b>

18:20.620 --> 18:22.870
<b>Let me tell you something important.</b>

18:23.160 --> 18:26.870
<b>Guys like you, who fight for themselves...</b>

18:27.460 --> 18:32.630
<b>never stand a chance against
my determination to save my little sister.</b>

18:36.670 --> 18:41.470
<b>You cannot escape from the Sea Field
that I have created.</b>

18:41.470 --> 18:44.930
<b>Now, the hunt's on, Mushroom Head!</b>

18:47.390 --> 18:50.770
<b><i>I felt like something passed by me
at tremendous speed.</i></b>

18:51.190 --> 18:52.270
<b><i>But that's ridiculous.</i></b>

18:52.770 --> 18:56.150
<b><i>Humans can't swim faster
than 10km per hour.</i></b>

18:56.150 --> 18:58.150
<b><i>I must have imagined it.</i></b>

18:58.400 --> 19:02.780
<b><i>Although I don't see Mushroom Head
anywhere. Where could he...</i></b>

19:06.830 --> 19:09.420
<b><i>Wait, back when he fell under my spell...</i></b>

19:10.370 --> 19:13.500
<b><i>didn't he say he couldn't swim?</i></b>

19:13.840 --> 19:15.210
<b>"I COULD SWIM MORE THAN I THOUGHT."</b>

19:16.460 --> 19:17.800
<b><i>What was that?</i></b>

19:18.090 --> 19:20.760
<b>"I HAD THOUGHT I COULDN'T SWIM, SO THANK YOU."</b>

19:21.010 --> 19:22.800
<b><i>He's thanking me for something.</i></b>

19:22.970 --> 19:25.310
<b><i>I-I can't see him. Not even his shadow!</i></b>

19:28.560 --> 19:31.270
<b><i>So this is how it feels to be hunted...</i></b>

19:31.600 --> 19:35.070
<b><i>All right. I will get serious about this.</i></b>

19:35.230 --> 19:37.570
<b>SeaShark Evolution!</b>

19:41.910 --> 19:46.330
<b>Now that I am in this form,
nobody can stop...</b>

20:00.130 --> 20:01.430
<b>You did it?</b>

20:01.680 --> 20:02.640
<b>Yeah.</b>

20:05.140 --> 20:06.970
<b>Magia Lupus.</b>

20:07.140 --> 20:10.480
<b>If this is the power
of the sixth and seventh...</b>

20:11.480 --> 20:13.350
<b>I think we've got this.</b>

20:14.100 --> 20:16.900
<b>You saying it
kinda loses the dramatic tension.</b>

20:18.690 --> 20:20.280
<b>Oh dear.</b>

20:20.490 --> 20:22.780
<b>Such a terrible thing to say about us.</b>

20:23.860 --> 20:25.700
<b>However...</b>

20:30.580 --> 20:33.290
<b>Aren't you jumping to conclusions?</b>

20:34.500 --> 20:35.170
<b>Graviole.</b>

20:38.710 --> 20:40.550
<b><i>I can't use my magic?</i></b>

20:44.550 --> 20:46.390
<b>Please calm down.</b>

20:46.390 --> 20:48.220
<b>I'm only here for my allies.</b>

20:51.390 --> 20:53.560
<b>You're quite menacing, though.</b>

20:59.900 --> 21:02.650
<b><i>What was that just now?
Did he teleport?</i></b>

21:02.990 --> 21:04.490
<b><i>Is this magic?</i></b>

21:04.740 --> 21:07.780
<b>I apologize for seeming menacing.</b>

21:08.120 --> 21:10.870
<b>I merely wanted a small glimpse.</b>

21:11.790 --> 21:15.670
<b>But it is also true that I came here
to retrieve my allies.</b>

21:16.420 --> 21:18.750
<b>You don't need to worry just yet.</b>

21:19.590 --> 21:21.460
<b>We will meet again soon.</b>

21:24.720 --> 21:26.970
<b>Now, good day.</b>

21:29.720 --> 21:31.640
<b>I take it back.</b>

21:31.640 --> 21:36.520
<b>Crushing them will be worthwhile after all.</b>

21:48.570 --> 21:50.200
<b>In that moment...</b>

21:52.330 --> 21:54.870
<b>Such speed, and with no magic...</b>

21:55.660 --> 21:59.500
<b>Then he is the same type as me.</b>

23:35.310 --> 23:40.020
<b>NEXT EPISODE
MASH BURNEDEAD AND THE WOLVES OF MAGIC</b>
